/**
 * Thread Admin — JSX version of Thread_admin.html
 *
 * The markup, styles and behaviour are carried over 1:1 (same colours, icons,
 * designs, dark mode, library, ticks, reports, etc.), so the UI is unchanged.
 *
 * Sidebar change: the collapse button is no longer in the dashboard header.
 * It sits at the top of the sidebar:
 *   - expanded  -> section icon + section name
 *   - collapsed -> section icon only
 * State is saved on this device and Ctrl/Cmd + B toggles it. On phones the
 * sidebar is a drawer, opened with the menu button.
 */
 
