    "var TPL={privacy:['# What we collect','- Account details: your name, username, email, photo and bio.','- Content you share: posts, stories, notes, messages, voice messages, snaps and files.','- Device permissions you choose to allow: camera, microphone and location (for the map).','- Basic usage data such as sign-in times and crash reports.','','# How we use it','- To run {{app}}: show your profile, deliver messages and keep your account secure.','- To improve features and keep the community safe.','- We do not sell your personal data.','','# Services we use','- Spotify for music in notes, GIPHY for GIFs and Google Maps for the map. They only receive what they need to work and have their own policies.','','# Your choices','- Edit or delete your posts, stories and notes at any time.','- Turn camera, microphone and location off in your device settings.','- Switch to a private account in Settings.','- Ask us to delete your account and data at {{contact}}.','','# Children','- {{app}} is not meant for children under 13, or the minimum age in your country.','','# Changes','- If we change this policy we will update the date and tell you in the app.','','# Contact','- Questions about privacy: {{contact}}'].join('\\n'),",
    "terms:['# Using {{app}}','- You must be old enough to use {{app}} in your country, and at least 13.','- You are responsible for your account and for keeping your password safe.','','# Your content','- You own what you post. You allow {{app}} to store and show it so the service can work.','- Do not post anything you do not have the right to share.','','# Community rules','- No harassment, hate, threats, spam, scams or impersonation.','- No sexual content involving minors, graphic violence or illegal activity.','- We may remove content or suspend accounts that break these rules.','','# Premium','- Premium plans renew until cancelled. The price and trial length are shown before you pay.','','# The service','- We may change or stop features. We work to keep {{app}} available but cannot promise it will never be interrupted.','','# Ending your account','- You can delete your account at any time. We can suspend or remove accounts that break these terms.','','# Contact','- Questions about these terms: {{contact}}'].join('\\n')};",
